      "problem": "cache_probe只检CPU1/BOOT_MODE和raw256B，未查epoch0/IDLE/PS拥有/ledger0；RUN epoch7及IDLE epoch7均执行DAP arena写并返回CROSS_MASTER_256_BYTES_MATCHED。",
